Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target planet on maximum\Ntelefinder range in 5, 4, 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, this could be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure looks promising this\Ntime, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.74,0:01:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a good feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that planet is\Ngoing to be our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to our preliminary\Nobservational data,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:01:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems to be reasonably similar to home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the scientific crap already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we take a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's land this puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done the cold sleep five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get frozen one more\Ntime, we'll swivel up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a pig, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to\Nsettle here, and besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whether we land or not, that's\Nnot a decision for us to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It definitely has a habitable environment,\Nbut it has no existing oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and its stratum consists mostly of quartz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth waking up the old men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, just out of curiosity, what\Nkind of flowers are on that planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to\Nwhat I said before, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That planet doesn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll decide once the results\Nof the minute analysis are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all we know, it just might\Nhave the flowers Rem thinks it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it does, I sure hope\Nthey'll be red flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, why\Ndon't they ever wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me and Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even with the rest of the\Ncrew, there are only seven of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day has finally come to tell you what\Nis written on the outside of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, Project Seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Project Seeds? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These ships are like seeds that\Nare filled with our own genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genes from the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are sent off to discover\Nand populate an unknown world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could say that we are\Nthe caretakers of all those seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.52,0:03:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a god in deep space, he\Nmust be laughing at us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our pitiful struggle for immortality must\Nlook like an impossible quest to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it may look shameful\Nto others, it represents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all of us, the desperate human will\Nto survive, to carry on our species.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When they arrive, a fight\Non a new land awaits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is their home,\Nand until it's time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's our job to let them sleep in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, is there anything\Nwe can do to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you want to have lunch in\Nthe usual place, in the rec room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really like that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to pop into my\Nhead whenever I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a nice song.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's actually been moved around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But every time we come here this\Nplace seems different for some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has its own rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can actually feel the\Nliving part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she goes again thinking about home
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this looks like the world you\Nand the others keep talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well sort of but the scenery\Nat home was actually much more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expansive with a lot more\Nvariety of plants and animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see that Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not just going to see\Nit We're going to create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find a place to create our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be nothing but peaceful\Ndays, with no war and no stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Eden where people can live\Nin freedom and harmony, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The state of our home, Earth, was so\Ndesperate, we had no choice but to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mankind could no longer survive there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire population was facing death,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so Project SEES was drafted as\Na way to resolve this crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.58,0:05:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, that's our ship, the\None you told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from the computer data,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks to me like mankind is\Nresponsible for damaging the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our young race believed the land\Nand resources were unlimited,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which led to gradual destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time they realized what\Nthey had done, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The planet could no longer take the abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, why did they come up with\Nthe idea to set this project in motion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.60,0:06:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The need to survive. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The behavior of clinging to life till the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,verge of death is\Nintrinsic to all organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survival instincts take over\Ndismissing shame in order to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But is it right to live if it\Nmeans such huge sacrifices?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We make the smallest sacrifice\Nwe can think of at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike the other organisms on\Nthe planet, we possess logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The knowledge to minimize the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, as human beings, we have\Nthe ability to right our wrongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, we'll learn from our\Nmistakes and start over in a new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we need to take time to\Nsearch and think of ways to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make everyone happy without\Nendangering our environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out to be an educator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only teach them\Nhow to use the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the first\Nthing about raising kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes double for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're teaching them all sorts\Nof things, like emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how to be kind to others,\Nand the value of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that great, Joey, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just play with them, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess we just have a\Ndifferent way of looking at things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I was thinking, why do\Nyou suppose they came here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're angels. Angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should pay\Nmore attention to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash and Knives could be angels God\Nsent to point us in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may even guide us through our dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.46,0:07:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's with the kids in the rec room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like there isn't a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently she doesn't realize we\Nstill have three plants left to adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, I meant to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two little guys took care\Nof those while you were napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're kidding, Rowan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fast, but that's still\Na two-day job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be surprised about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their IQ is way above ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:07:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take it so personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be glad\Nthey're willing to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're better suited\Nfor brain work than you, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to lighten up\Non those kids a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want the ship left\Nin the hands of those monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at how big\Nthey grew in one year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kids are monsters, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash. Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're crying again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says that we're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard to understand, but to\Nthese people, we're just uninvited guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only need to be patient for a\Nlittle while until they accept us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Rem said that we could stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think she feels that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what Joey said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make the smallest\Nsacrifice we can think of at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can do that, we\Ncan get through anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vash, do you know\Nwhy plants can't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem said it's because\Nthey're stronger than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said they're so strong, they\Nconcentrate all their energy on living,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they don't need to use words.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're strong,\Nbut we eat their fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to eat their fruit to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll be eating someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Knives, definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.98,0:09:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least according to Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said they're making\Na different kind of Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is off limits to your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that, monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives, it won't be much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is turning into quite a trim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never noticed before,\Nbut you're really handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really suits you, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it reminds me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone I loved very much back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is he now, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is in the land of angels, heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was my emotional support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, I was able to face\Nmy mistakes without judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned to make them right again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I lost him and realized\Nthat I would have to do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't afraid to\Nmake mistakes anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believed I could point myself in the\Nright direction without looking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why I got on this ship,\Nso I could enter the future as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, are you sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't, because\NI really love you, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thank you, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we switch now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, somehow I knew you'd be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a small change of heart, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we stay the same,\Nthere's no individuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful\Nhaircut, Knives! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As strange as it may sound,\NI actually feel refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you look very intellectual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you look like a\Nregular little philosopher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mama's boy. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you can stomach eating at the\Nsame table with those little monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steve, I think you've had one too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Steve, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have some work you\Nstill have to do somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always do that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that any way for a\Ngrown man like you to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,behave in the presence\Nof innocent children?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure has been acting crazy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because he's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is draping\Nhimself all over Mary like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, I suppose just\None would be rather boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the easiest way to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.18,0:13:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to save the butterfly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Didn't want to kill the spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save them both
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about\Nunless the spider caught
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the butterfly it would\Ndie of starvation anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't save both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not right to make\Nthat choice so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of them are living creatures knives,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you should but I'm not\Nwrong about this realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you just keep saving the\Nbutterflies the spiders will die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanting to save both is\Njust a naive contradiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what would you have rather had us do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stand and think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, while we do that,\Nthe spider eats the butterfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Nye?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to save both of them, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't make any sense, Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to interplanetary\Nlaw, Steve is relieved of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will be detained in the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, upon the\Ncompletion of our mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.56,0:14:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he will be released from\Ndetention to stand trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was get a little drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you believe what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't heard his side yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not being fair to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw him go into Mary's room,\Nand I find that unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have time to discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for us to function\Nas a group, we need law.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It protects all of us from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire team must understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe it wouldn't hurt to hear his\Nside of the story before we freeze him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, he raped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, why can't everyone just\Nget along with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's because people have\Nmany different ways of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if we do make mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have the ability to do something about\Nit and make better choices the next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you keep your vision\Nclear, you will see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens in our future\Nis our own responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you must be teasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we're finished here,\NI'd like you to come to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The analysis should be in\Nin just a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made sure that Steve\Nwill never wake up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.64,0:16:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I readjusted the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for us to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess now that means we're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Rem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The A-12 monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody disconnected them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her own fault. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I helped her and then she betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to\Nprotect her from Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.70,0:16:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rowan, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She even told me she loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's simply no excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, you do understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of him, Mary had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Rowan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, what's happening? Rem! Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get away with it, that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of the way, Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has the right to\Ntake the life of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay! Stay! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rowan, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's broken inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Rowan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay back, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Rowan, nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.20,0:18:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, he would have shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, there was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.74,0:18:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Rowan, he wouldn't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please understand, I couldn't\Nsee that from the monitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to decide quickly. If I hadn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rowan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joey, I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you did exactly the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rowan went crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if Rem was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he wasn't going to shoot her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.28,0:18:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, what I did\Nwas a horrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a human,\Nlike the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know my choice is the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altering ship's course program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're changing direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our course has been re-entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone is sending orders\Nto all of the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All systems are now operating\Non auto-lock mode. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the ships are\Ngoing to crash on that planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Rowan had started\Nup the orbital program.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told me to get us to the escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he'd try to save the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about all the\Nsleeping people on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to go to the pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warning. Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is about to\Nenter the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please proceed to the escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.22,0:19:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please proceed to the escape pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to hurry, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fight on a new land awaits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to see it.\NWe're going to create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you keep your vision\Nclear, you will see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens in our future\Nis our own responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ram, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alex, help me. Give me strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave Joey here by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have to try to find\Na way to save the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the program is already running.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to come with us, Ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Alex were still alive, I believe in\Nmy heart that he would do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, take care of knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come back, Rem!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a total waste of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think they'd actually sacrifice themselves\Nout of foolish sentiment for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incomprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd let her live only\Nbecause you were so attached to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I see how truly\Nimperfect she really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their immigration is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be like spreading pathogenic\Norganisms across our healthy universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.66,0:21:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you planned\Nthis? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, you and I will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made sure the planned ship will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we need that\Nto create our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, won't we, my dearest brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only ships carrying the humans will crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring them back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All ships now commencing\Norbital correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverse thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bitch actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:21:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, take care of knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.38,0:23:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aishita o mitsumete, Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shining down upon us from the\Nskies, stained red with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.50,0:24:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let us remember his name, his legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do so, you only need to look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, his legend is\Nchiseled into the fifth moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.94,0:24:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a permanent etching from a terrible past.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legend of Vash the\NStampede, chiseled forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then the time comes, you\Nonly need to tell of the tracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which lead to the future.

